and is released under the same BSD 2-Clause License (see LICENSE). It is an
independent reimplementation that follows the reference evoc's algorithm and
numerical behaviour (validated bit-exact per-stage against evoc 0.3.1); it is
not endorsed by or affiliated with the original authors.
